      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each level\u2019s grid to step onto and activate all goal cells. A goal only completes when the carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the moment you enter the goal tile; completing all goals advances levels, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (north/south/east/west) costs 1 stamina. When stamina reaches 0, you lose 1 life and stamina resets to its maximum; losing all lives ends the game (GAME_OVER). Movement is constrained by walls, represented by a per-turn blocked_directions list that must never be chosen. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape modifiers cycle shape IDs 0\u20135 (wrapping), color modifiers cycle colors in order orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation modifiers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u00b0\u219290\u00b0\u2192180\u00b0\u2192270\u00b0\u21920\u00b0). Goal tiles only activate when shape, color, and rotation all match simultaneously; then stepping onto the tile completes that goal. Stamina refill tiles restore stamina."
      }
